{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-where|T77", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’m… »", "passage": "phonepick-time-where", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-where|T78", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "For a second, you think she’s going to tell you. But then…", "passage": "phonepick-time-where", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-where|T79", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Somewhere. None of your business. »", "passage": "phonepick-time-where", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-where|T80", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A light clinking noise… the sound of a teacup on a coaster maybe?", "passage": "phonepick-time-where", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-name|T85", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Perfect. I’m listening. »", "passage": "phonepick-time-name", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-time-silence|T90", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Good… »", "passage": "phonepick-time-silence", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Bien… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name-intro|T95", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’m listening. What have you got for me? »", "passage": "phonepick-name-intro", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name-intro|T96", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She clears her throat. Her voice sounds… louder… more confident.", "passage": "phonepick-name-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T101", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You glance at the wall. The suspects are all lined up. All the evidence. A whole mess of your ideas. Your stomach is in a knot.", "passage": "phonepick-name", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T103", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I don’t have to remind you, you cannot get this wrong. I have a meeting in two hours with the District Attorney. And the Chief of Police. »", "passage": "phonepick-name", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T104", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Even the Minister of the Interior will be in a corner of the room somewhere. »", "passage": "phonepick-name", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T106", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Obviously, I’m thrilled. Oh, oh, but, I certainly don’t want to put too much pressure on you. »", "passage": "phonepick-name", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T108", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You can almost hear the smirk she must be wearing.", "passage": "phonepick-name", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "926_phone_pickone|phonepick-name|T109", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You lay the receiver down on the table. Now, you have to decide.", "passage": "phonepick-name", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
